이 되는 자)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;2. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">박사과정 졸업예정자 학위논문 학술지 게재 실적제출<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(석사과정생은 해당없음)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;￭제출논문 조건 : 재학중에 학생명의(공동연구자포함)로 해외저명 학술지에 1편 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;이상 또는 국내 전국 규모 학술지에 2편 이상 게재된 논문</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;￭게재된 경우 : 논문 별쇄본 1부</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;￭</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--StartFragment--><font color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">게재 예정인 경우 : 게재(예정)증명서 1부</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(게재예정일자가 논문심사완료일(09.12.18.) 이전 일것</span>&nbsp;<br><br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIG